C4 Display_Power_Switch Net-_U2-K_ 1uF
C3 Net-_U1-A_ Net-_Q1-D_ 4.7uF
C6 Display_Power_Switch Net-_U3-A_ 1uF
C2 Display_Power_Switch Display_Power_Switch 1uF
L1 Net-_Q1-D_ Display_Power_Switch 10u
R1 Net-_Q1-S_ Display_Power_Switch 0.47
C1 Display_Power_Switch Display_Power_Switch 0.1uF
C8 Net-_C8-Pad1_ Display_Power_Switch 1uF
C9 Net-_C9-Pad1_ Display_Power_Switch 1uF
C7 Net-_C7-Pad1_ Display_Power_Switch 1uF
C10 Net-_C10-Pad1_ Display_Power_Switch 1uF
